<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Often we are distressed,</l><l>In a pit or slavery.</l><l>But we’re not there on our own;</l><l>Jehovah’s there with us,</l><l>And He is working the most</l><l>When it seems like all is wrong,</l><l>When we are very low,</l><l>He supplies and cares for us.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
